<title>MALAYSIA: Pengkalen suspended for announcement-KLSE.</title>
<headline>Pengkalen suspended for announcement-KLSE.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Malaysian footwear company Pengkalen Industrial Holdings Bhd were suspended at the company's request for an announcement, said an official at the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange on Friday.</p>
<p>The shares were suspended shortly after the opening of the afternoon session.</p>
<p>Company officials were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>Pengkalen shares were last traded at 9.80 ringgit, down 10 cents on the previous day's close.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
